&ANALYZE-RESUME


&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE adm-row-available D-Dialog _ADM-ROW-AVAILABLE
PROCEDURE adm-row-available :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
